# SwarmForge Constitution

This file takes precedence over article files.
Read and obey every file in `swarmforge/constitution/articles/`.

# NOOA Project Override

This is a Python/uv/NOOA project, not a Clojure project. Do not clone, install,
or run Clojure analysis tools, the Acceptance Pipeline Specification, Gherkin
tools, mutation tools, CRAP, DRY, property-testing frameworks, or any other
tool unless the assigned task explicitly requires it. Do not perform startup
tool bootstrap. The project article is the authoritative tool and verification
policy for this project.
